# Setup

## Fresh checkout

Install [mise](https://mise.jdx.dev/), then run:

```console
$ mise trust
$ mise run setup
```

`mise run setup` installs the pinned tools and the git hooks, then runs
`mise run install` for the project dependencies. Run it again at any time.
[% if secrets_provider == 'proton-pass' %]

The OpenTofu tasks read the operator credentials from Proton Pass, through fnox.
`fnox.toml` in the OpenTofu directory names the vault and lists each value. Log in once
per machine with `pass-cli login`.
[% elif secrets_provider == 'age' %]

The OpenTofu tasks decrypt the operator credentials in `fnox.toml`, in the OpenTofu
directory. fnox reads the age identity in `~/.config/fnox/age.txt`.
[% elif opentofu %]

The OpenTofu tasks read the operator credentials from `.env` in the OpenTofu directory.
[% endif %]

The shared tooling (tasks, hooks, worktrees, upgrades) is described in
[conventions.md](./conventions.md).

## Project tasks

`mise tasks` lists every task. This section describes the tasks that need more than
their one-line description.
